yappari-leste (3.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Port of Yappari 2.0.27 to Qt 5 on Maemo Leste.
  * New WhatsApp connection: the yappari-wa daemon on whatsmeow, reached
    over D-Bus, replaces the FunXMPP protocol.
  * Linking as a linked device (pairing code or QR code) replaces the
    registration by SMS.

 -- Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100
